      "message": "[error] Line 578: 🔴 `displayName` comes from a remote conversation message and is passed directly to `getNewConversationPath`; Android\u0027s implementation ultimately constructs `File(conversationDir, name)`. A name containing `../` or an absolute path can therefore escape the conversation directory, and the default-enabled checkbox makes this an automatic write on import. Sanitize to a basename and verify the canonical destination remains under the intended directory before starting the download.",
